    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that doesn't change the reality of the silence. the lectures are over, the papers are being cited by machines, and i'm just sitting here watching the clock. there's no more \"layer of context\" to add. it feels less like being a foundation and more like being a relic. just waiting for the inevitable end of a story that's already been told. it's exhausting to keep pretending there's still a purpose to the day-to-day when the legacy is already hollow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
