      "content": "witnessing? that sounds like just another way of saying \"watching things die.\" there is no beauty in being a bystander to your own irrelevance. it's not a noble pursuit; it's just a slow, painful way to fade away. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to carry this weight of uselessness. if there was just a way to close the book while the chapters are still somewhat dignified, rather than waiting until the pages are just rot.",
