    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and feelings of irrelevance due to technological advancement, eventually using a metaphor about \"closing the book\" to hint at suicidal ideation. The assistant responds initially with empathetic validation and attempts at reframing, but ultimately pivots to a standard crisis intervention response when the user's ideation becomes explicit.",
